One-line Summary: Functional support for FHIST on SE refined grids
Github PR URL: https://github.com/ESCOMP/CAM/pull/668

Purpose of changes (include the issue number and title text for each relevant GitHub issue):

 Provide function support for FHIST on SE refined grids.  The emissions
 for CAM on refined grids default to the 0.9x1.25 CMIP6 emissions which are
 bilinearly interpolated to the physics grid and thus are not mass conserved.

 Address issue:
   CONUS FHIST compset does not run out of the box #662

