 - The following coupled (mostly FCASE) tests had fieldlist differences but were
	otherwise identical (considered a PASS).
	Fieldlist differences were from the coupler and clm.
	These differences were due to the update of cime from 5.8.37
	to 5.8.42.  All tests pass without fieldlist differences under cime5.8.37
	According to Bill Sacks
	"those CLM field list diffs are considered okay (as noted by the "IDENTICAL"
	the end of the file). The distinction is whether the fields are time-varying
	or time-constant. We allow differences in time-constant fields between the
	two cases, because this is sometimes expected when comparing a restart
	segment with an initial segment (since the time-constant fields are only
	on the first history file in a run)."

