    . cam_physics_mesh
    . oplus_grid
    . edyn_grid
    . ionos_npes
 - prescribed high-latitude potential settings (for multiple files):
    . ionos_epotential_amie
    . amienh_files
    . amiesh_files
    . ionos_epotential_ltr
    . ltr_files

