One-line Summary: Enable CAM configure option "-chem none" with cam6 physics
Github PR URL: https://github.com/ESCOMP/CAM/pull/276

Purpose of changes (include the issue number and title text for each relevant GitHub issue):

 Set namelist option use_hetfrz_classnuc to .false. if prognostic modal aerosols
 are not included in the model configuration.  The interface layer to the heterogeneous
 freezing parameterization assumes modal aerosols are available in the simulation.
