Tag name: cam6_3_001
Originator(s): katetc
Date: 2020-10-06
One-line Summary: Microphysics optional updates to match the IFS model, plus misc bug fixes
Github PR URL: https://github.com/ESCOMP/CAM/pull/178

Purpose of changes (include the issue number and title text for each relevant GitHub issue):
 - PUMAS SCAM and IFS updates (#162)
 - CAM_ROOT not correctly set in test_driver.sh (#206)

Describe any changes made to build system: Update to test_driver.sh to point to correct
	source root. Change default Izumi PE layout to 24 tasks on Izumi.

Describe any changes made to the namelist: Added 12 new switches to control IFS options and
	to make updates to sedimentation optional.

List any changes to the defaults for the boundary datasets: None

Describe any substantial timing or memory changes: New, smaller, default PE layout on Izumi
	increases time required to run.

Code reviewed by: gold2718, brian-eaton, cacraigucar, nusbaume

List all files eliminated: None

List all files added and what they do:
A  cime_config/usermods_dirs/scam_micre2017/user_nl_cam
A  cime_config/usermods_dirs/scam_micre2017/shell_commands
	- Added scripts and settings for the micre2017 scam iop

List all existing files that have been modified, and describe the changes:
M  ChangeLog
	- Added this entry
M  Externals_CAM.cfg
	- Update PUMAS external to pumas_cam-release_v1.8
M  bld/namelist_files/namelist_definition.xml
	- Added switches to turn on IFS options or sedimentation changes
	- Change default values for micro_mg_ngnst, micro_mg_nrnst,
	  and micro_mg_nsnst
M  bld/scripts/create_scam6_iop
	- Fix location of usermods_dir with new CAM source tree
M  bld/scripts/create_scam6_iop_multi
	- Fix location of usermods_dir with new CAM source tree
M  src/physics/cam/micro_mg_cam.F90
	- Added 12 new namelist switches to turn the IFS behavior on and off,
	to specify constant rain or snow number, and to make the change in
	snow and graupel sedimentation optional (default off).
	- New values for parameters: micro_mg_ncnst, micro_mg_ninst,
	micro_mg_nrnst, micro_mg_nsnst, micro_mg_ngnst
	- New parameter list for micro_mg_cam_init call
	- New history output fields: MELTSTOT (Melting of snow), MNUDEPO
	(Deposition Nucleation), MELTGTOT (Melting of graupel)
	- New parameter list for micro_mg_cam_tend_pack including these outflds
M  test/system/test_driver.sh
	- Update CAM_ROOT path
M  cime_config/config_pes.xml
	- Change default Izumi layout to 24 PEs

