Tag name: cam6_2_041
Originator(s): fischer
Date: Fri Aug 14 11:19:23 MDT 2020
One-line Summary: Transition testing to cime scripts.
Github PR URL: https://github.com/ESCOMP/CAM/pull/30

Purpose of changes (include the issue number and title text for each relevant GitHub issue):
. This tag replaces all of the CAM stand alone tests, with tests that use the
  cime scripts.  test_driver.sh no longer automatically runs the CAM stand alone
  tests.  Testing will use the same test_driver.sh commands as before.
  Test results can be found in $mach_workspace/$LOGNAME/aux_cam* directories
  using the cs.status.$test_id command.

. Baselines are automatically store in the $mach_workspace/$LOGNAME/$test_id/baselines.
  This speeds up the archive_baseline.sh significantly.

Describe any changes made to build system:

Describe any changes made to the namelist:
.  Add new WACCM aquaplanet use_case.
.  Add ic file for T42 with a start date of 901.
.  Don't set solar_const for WACCM/cam4 aquaplanet test.


