Tag name: cam6_2_039
Originator(s): pel, jet, goldy
Date: Tue Jul 21 11:02:31 MDT 2020
One-line Summary: port of GFDL FV3 dycore to CAM/CESM
Github PR URL: https://github.com/ESCOMP/CAM/pull/78

Purpose of changes (include the issue number and title text for each relevant GitHub issue):
The FV3 interface was based on the CAM-SE implementation. The core FV3 routines under
atmos_cubed_sphere directory are compiled into a library that is linked to CESM. The FV3
library code is pulled from https://github.com/ESCOMP/FV3_CESM.git which is a copy of the
NOAA_EMS FV3 library with a few small mods needed to run the FV3-CAM port.

	The FV3-CAM code consists of:

	. CAM-FV3 interface routines (src/dynamics/fv3)
	. NOAA_EMS-FV3 library routines (src/dynamics/fv3/atmos_cubed_sphere)
	. 2 GFS physics routines that are 'used' by the dynamics
	. GFDL FMS library code to handle the MPI communication CAM

Describe any changes made to build system:
. CESM/CAM build scripts were modified to create a new fv3 dycore library.
. Additionally the script to build the new FV3 dycore also builds the GFDL FMS
	library included for FV3 and MOM.

Describe any changes made to the namelist: none

. new variables for FV3

List any changes to the defaults for the boundary datasets:

. new ncdata, bnd_topo files for FV3 grids

Describe any substantial timing or memory changes:
. evaluation of the new dycore is ongoing.

Code reviewed by: fvitt, cacraig, goldy, nusbaume, eaton, pel

List all files eliminated: none

List all files added and what they do:

. src/dynamics/fv3/dimensions_mod.F90
	- control module holding fv3 grid dimensions
. src/dynamics/fv3/dp_coupling.F90
	- provide coupling interface between physics and fv3 dycore
. src/dynamics/fv3/dycore.F90
	- dycore_is function for FV3
. src/dynamics/fv3/dyn_comp.F90
	- implements dyn_comp interface for FV3, it contains dynamics api
	  to initialize, run, and finalize new fv3 dycore.
. src/dynamics/fv3/dyn_grid.F90
	- api to set up new fv3 dynamics grid and provide fv3 grid interface routines to the physics.
. src/dynamics/fv3/interp_mod.F90
	- currently a stub but will contain functionality to interpolate fv3 output to lat/lon grid.
. src/dynamics/fv3/Makefile.in.fv3
	- template makefile for building FV3
. src/dynamics/fv3/pmgrid.F90
	- holds plev and plevp for the fv3 dycore, also defines PLON and PLAT which are dummy module variables for FV3
. src/dynamics/fv3/restart_dynamics.F90
	- fv3 routines to read and write fv3 gridded restart files.
. src/dynamics/fv3/spmd_dyn.F90
	holds variables set in phys_grid and used by fv3.
. src/dynamics/fv3/stepon.F90
	- implements stepon interface for fv3.

List all existing files that have been modified, and describe the changes:
. Externals.cfg
	-new external for FMS
. Externals_CAM.cfg
	-new external for atmos_cubed_sphere (new FV3 library)
. bld/Makefile.in
	- modified to create new fv3 dycore library.
. bld/build-namelist
	- added new namelist fv3 namelist groups and fv3 dycore control parameters
. bld/config_files/defaults.xml
	- added defaults for FV3 C24/C48/C96/C192/C384 resolutions.
. bld/config_files/definition.xml
	- added new fv3 group and control variables
. bld/configure
	- added fv3 dycore and associated functionality as a new option to configure.
. cime_config/buildcpp
	- added new configure options for fv3.
. cime_config/buildlib
	- added functionality to build fms library before building CAM/fv3 library.
