Tag name: cam6_2_034
Originator(s): pel, eaton
Date: Mon 06 Jul 2020 09:41:15 AM MDT
One-line Summary: SE updates for release; physconst refactor.
Github PR URL: https://github.com/ESCOMP/CAM/pull/153

Purpose of changes (include the issue number and title text for each relevant GitHub issue):

SE updates for release. #139

. Address instabilities in WACCM simulations:
  - new sponge layer formulation (WACCM only)
  - code for horizontal and vertical molecular diffusion and thermal
    conductivity in the SE dynamical core

. Generalized calculation of species dependent thermodynamic properties
  of dry air used by WACCM-X.  Only supported for FV/WACCM-X.  SE/WACCM-X
  is still under development.

. Refactoring in physconst.F90 for general compositions of air
  and more accurate moist thermodynamics.

. Add FV3 remapping functionality to improve total energy conservation
  properties and QBO simulations with lower vertical resolution.

. Add spun-up initial condition for various CAM and WACCM configurations.

. Bug fix in the computation of OMEGA in SE dycore.

Describe any changes made to build system: none

Describe any changes made to the namelist:
. add se_vert_remap_T, se_vert_remap_uvTq_alg, and se_vert_remap_tracer_alg
. remove se_qsize_condensate_loading and se_variable_nsplit
. add dry_air_species and water_species_in_air

List any changes to the defaults for the boundary datasets: none

Describe any substantial timing or memory changes: not checked

