Describe any changes made to build system:

Describe any changes made to the namelist:
  New CLUBB namelists (see namelist_definition.xml for full details)
    clubb_C4 - C4 coeff in the wp2 return-to-isotropy term
    clubb_c_K9 - coeff of Kh_zm in the up2 and vp2 predictive equations
    clubb_nu9 - constant in the diffusivity term in the up2 and vp2 predictive equations
    clubb_c_wp2_splat = coeff for gusiness near ground
    clubb_l_diag_Lscale_from_tau - flag to control Lscale and dissipation calc
    clubb_l_damp_wp2_using_em - flag to use Bougeault dissipation formula

Some CLUBB namelist default settings changed for SILHS runs:
    clubb_do_adv = .false.
    clubb_l_rcm_supersat_adj = .false.
    clubb_c14 = 1.0

