Tag name: cam6_2_014
Originator(s): cacraig, andrew
Date: Feb 19, 2020
One-line Summary: Fix empty_htapes bug fix, MG3 minor mods, remove unused vars and store
   CAM baselines in AMWG space on cheyenne

Purpose of changes:
- empty_htapes was accidentally forced to always be false beginning in cam6_2_011 - fixed
- MG3 changes:  The code will tolerate both do_graupel and do_hail=TRUE (CAM at higher levels
     does not allow it, but the microphysics does permit it). The changes move the places where
     do_graupel and do_hail appear separately so that graupel is always last. This will give
     an equivalent result to do_graupel = true, do_hail = false when both are true.

Bugs fixed (include bugzilla ID): empty_htapes always being set to false has been fixed

