Tag name: cam6_1_030
Originator(s): katec, gettleman,
Date: Thu 15 Aug 2019
One-line Summary: Addition of MG3 microphysics, remove MG2 file

Purpose of changes:
. Addtion of MG3 microphysics
	- Add in prognostic graupel or hail, as documented in Gettleman et
	al. 2019.
	- Includes all namelist changes, configuration changes, and a test
	in the cam_aux suite.
	- This microphysics scheme is an option, and not a default in any
	compset or physics package at this time.

. Removed MG2 file
	- Because MG3 allows for B4B MG2 reproducability with a given set of
	namelist options, we removed the micro_mg2_0.F90 file and implement
	MG2 with MG3 (micro_mg_do_hail=.false. and micro_mg_do_graupel=.false.)
	going forward.

Bugs fixed (include bugzilla ID): none

Describe any changes made to build system: none

Describe any changes made to the namelist: Added
	micro_mg_do_graupel = .false. (for MG2 - default cam6)
	micro_mg_do_hail = .false. (for MG2 - default cam6)
	-> One or the other must be true for MG3 to activate, but both may not
	be true at the same time.
	graupel_in_rad = .false. (true for MG3)

List any changes to the defaults for the boundary datasets: none

Describe any substantial timing or memory changes: none

Code reviewed by: eaton, cacraig, goldy

