Tag name: cam6_1_029
Originator(s): pel, thomas.toniazzo@uni.no, eaton
Date: Thu 01 Aug 2019 12:12:47 PM MDT
One-line Summary: SE updates; AM conservation updates

Purpose of changes:

. Updates to SE dycore:
  - switch to tensor viscosity (Guba et al., 2014) and scale coefficients for
    better representation of flow over orography (only affects variable
    resolution)
  - automatically scale viscosity coefficients for tensor viscosity
  - switch to more consistent thermal energy physics-dynamics coupling
  - fix minor bug in sponge viscosity

. Updates to AM correction and fixer code (FV dycore only)
  - The settings that are being used in NorESM are:
    fv_am_diag        = .true.
    fv_high_order_top = .false.
    fv_am_geom_crrct  = .false.
    fv_am_correction  = .true.
    fv_am_fix_lbl     = .true.
    fv_am_fixer       = .true.
    do_circulation_diags = .true.

Bugs fixed (include bugzilla ID): above

