Tag name: cam6_1_023
Originator(s): fvitt
Date: 20 May 2019
One-line Summary: Fix WACCM-X temperature bug

Purpose of changes:

 Use wet mixing ratios in the calculation of variable gas properties for WACCM-X.
 Inconsistencies of the calculation of specific heat of air at different points
 in the code caused the energy fixer to apply a bias to the tendencies of dry
 static energy which drove the the temperatures down at all altitudes.

Bugs fixed (include bugzilla ID):

 The switch to dry mixing ratios for WACCM-X caused to the temperatures to drop
 throughout the whole domain.

Describe any changes made to build system:

