Tag name: cam6_1_007
Originator(s): jedwards, mvertens, eaton
Date: Mon Dec 17 10:36:14 MST 2018
One-line Summary: Replace MCT specific indices by coupler independent flags.

Purpose of changes:

. Replace references to MCT specific indices by use of coupler independent
  flags.  This allows CAM to query whether specific fields have been passed
  from or should be passed to the coupler in a coupler independent way.
  This is needed to implement the new nuopc coupler.

. minor bug fix in ncdio_atm.F90

