One-line Summary: mods for DART mode

Purpose of changes:

. Mods to allow running CAM with DART.  The main issue is that CAM needs to
  be able to run as an initial run when the model is restarted as a
  continuation run.  CAM examines data in the atm_resume component of the
  infodata structure passed from the driver to determine when it is running
  in DART mode.

