One-line Summary: Low level and gravity wave changes and several minor mods

Purpose of changes:

 - Namelist control variables added to gw_rdg.F90
 - Allow code to reproduce Scinocca&McFarlane 2000 downslope wind and flow splitting
   regimes, or modified regime definition using separate dividing streamlines
   for downslope wind and flow splitting
 - Optional smooth transitions to downslope wind regime implemented
