Tag name: cam5_4_49
Originator(s): cacraig
Date: February 16, 2016
One-line Summary: Revert iulog assignment back to what it was in cam5_4_42

Purpose of changes:
 - A request had been made to have QNEG3 lines not be directed to unit 6 (which is used by the CESM log).  An mpi_bcast
   was introduced in cam5_4_43 to broadcast the CAM iulog to all tasks, but that had issues with the gnu compiler during
   FLUSH.  After extensive investigation, it was determined that master should really be the only task which routinely
   writes to iulog.  This tag reverst the change made in cam5_4_43 and a future tage will create statistics for QNEG3
   that masterproc can write out.

Bugs fixed (include bugzilla ID):

