Tag name: cam5_4_14
Originator(s): bogensch, cacraig
Date: Sept 14, 2015
One-line Summary: CLUBB total energy adjustment modification

Purpose of changes:

 - Change of the vertical extent of the CLUBB total energy adjustment to limit
   the altitudes to where CLUBB is creating a significant tendency. CLUBB and CAM
   have different total energy definitions, and CLUBB is adjusted to match CAM.
   Previously energy adjustment was over the whole depth of the model, this
   limits it mostly to the troposphere.

