One-line Summary: Update WACCM-X with extended ionosphere

Purpose of changes:

 Add capability to switch on vertical ion transport ambipolar diffusion and
 electron and ion temperature calculations in WACCM-X.  This will give a more
 realistic simulation of the ionosphere in the model and is the next step in
 adding full thermosphere/ionosphere physics and dynamics to CESM.

 Also, added is the infrastructure for the more realistic setting of ions
 and electrons to short-lived non-transported species in the thermosphere/
 ionosphere but no species are set to short-lived..

