c0_lnd           0.0020              0.0059
c0_ocn           0.0150              0.0450
dp1              0.04                0.10
dp2              675.                500.
div24del2flag    2                   4

Notice that the 2 degree version has not been retuned and we use the
1 degree parameter for all resolution.

